          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>🚚 Shipping Information</h2><p>We ship Australia-wide with trusted carriers.</p><p>We will attempt to dispatch your goods via Australia Post within 1-2 working days.</p><p><strong>Standard  Delivery:</strong><br/>In normal circumstances please expect delivery within 5-10 Business Days (excluding weekends). For delivery to more remote areas and to WA please allow up to 5 extra days for delivery<br/><strong>Express Delivery:<br/></strong>If you live in a capital city delivery is normally next business day (once packed and sent). Usual Express Delivery times are 3-6 Business Days. Delivery to Western Australia can take up to 5 extra Business Days from New South Wales.  Delivery may take longer if you live in a rural area. Please see Australia Post website for estimated delivery times</p><h2>🏡 Free Local Pickup</h2><p>We offer <strong>free local pickup</strong> for customers in <strong>Woolgoolga, NSW</strong>.</p><p>Local pickup will appear as an option at checkout.<br/><br/>Once your order is ready, you’ll receive an email with <strong>collection details and the pickup address</strong>.</p><p>Please wait for confirmation before arriving.</p><p></p><p><strong>How does Shipping Protection work?</strong></p><p>We pack your order with love and care, but once it leaves us, it’s in the hands of the courier — and sometimes things don’t go to plan.</p><p>To give you peace of mind, we offer <strong>Shipping Protection</strong> at checkout. It’s a quick and easy way to ensure your order is covered if it’s <strong>lost or damaged in transit</strong>. This isn’t insurance — just a simple, stress-free way to get support fast.</p><p>If your parcel arrives damaged, send us a few clear photos of the packaging and items with your order number, and we’ll fast-track a <strong>replacement</strong> or offer <strong>store credit </strong>via our email <strong>contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</strong></p><p>If your parcel goes missing during transit, we’ll assess the situation promptly and provide a resolution — no need to wait weeks for courier investigations.</p><p>Without Shipping Protection, we’ll still do our best to help, but we’ll need to follow standard courier processes, which can take time.</p><p></p><h2>🔄Returns & Refunds</h2><p>At <strong>The Little Pioneers</strong>, we’re committed to creating high-quality, practical products that make everyday family life easier — and we want you to absolutely love your purchase.</p><p>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please email us at <a><strong>contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</strong></a> within <strong>30 days of receiving your order</strong>.</p><p>Please include:</p><ul><li>Your full name</li><li>The email used to place the order</li><li>Your order number</li><li>A brief description of the issue</li></ul><h4>Change of Mind</h4><p>We accept returns for change of mind within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>, provided items are:</p><ul><li>Unused and in original condition</li><li>In original packaging</li><li>Not washed or used for meals</li><li>Free from marks, damage, or strong odours<br/></li></ul><p>Once your return is received and approved, we will issue a <strong>refund for the product value</strong>, excluding original shipping costs.</p><p>Please note:</p><ul><li>Return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer</li><li>We recommend using tracked shipping, as we are not responsible for lost returns</li></ul><h4>Hygiene & Safety Considerations</h4><p>Due to the nature of our products (feeding and toddler items), we cannot accept returns on items that have been used for meals or show signs of extended use.</p><p>You are welcome to inspect items upon arrival, but once used, they are not eligible for return unless faulty.</p><h4>Partial Returns (Bundles)</h4><p>If you purchased a bundle or multi-item set:</p><ul><li>Only unused items will be eligible for refund</li><li>If some items have been used, we will refund only the unused portion</li></ul><h4>Non-Returnable Items</h4><p>The following items are not eligible for return:</p><ul><li>Used feeding products (plates, bowls, cups, lunch/snack boxes, bibs, cutlery)</li><li>Gift cards</li><li><strong>Seconds stock</strong> (items sold at a reduced price due to minor cosmetic imperfections but are fully functional)</li><li>Free gifts or bonus items (unless returned with the full order — see below)</li></ul><h4>Free Gifts & Promotional Offers</h4><p>If your order included a <strong>free gift or bonus item</strong> (e.g. “Spend $80, receive a free gift”):</p><ul><li>The free item must also be returned in unused condition</li><li>If not returned, the value of the item will be deducted from your refund</li></ul><h4>Faulty or Damaged Items</h4><p>We take quality seriously — but if something isn’t right, we’ll make it right.</p><p>If your item is <strong>faulty, damaged, or incorrect</strong>, please email us at <a><strong>contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</strong></a> with:</p><ul><li>Your order number</li><li>A description of the issue</li><li>Clear photos of the fault</li></ul><p>We will offer a <strong>replacement or full refund (including shipping costs)</strong> where applicable.</p><h4>Incorrect Items</h4><p>If you received the wrong item, please contact us and we will organise the correct product to be sent to you as soon as possible.</p><h4>📩 Need help? Email us at : contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</h4>"
          }
        }
